                <divLine xml:id="m-d590167a-bdf3-4ca0-82af-2fdddabfa328" facs="#m-6026c507-9c00-46b2-ac97-77cd2c3f4b10" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-a8c4d67c-d140-4ab9-abe1-40d28044da86">
              <lg xml:id="m-cffb96a3-fe17-47cb-a43b-0fef52449d94">
                <l xml:id="m-8ed4b04f-5774-4f9e-9c8a-f55eb5952d4f" facs="#m-0b7b92a2-e0c9-4451-b654-605108532dbe" label="text-like">23rd Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-5f1275f1-f743-439c-bfb9-f101985fa61b" facs="#m-c36ee252-de40-4768-aada-ce6866d4fa33" label="ambiguous">1077</l><l xml:id="m-7412f85b-0613-4f37-beff-317687b33861" facs="#m-81995386-d80a-4737-a323-a23cb504704e" label="ambiguous">am:</l><l xml:id="m-f78720e3-c3bc-464e-8541-b4a574f880e7" facs="#m-442cd43a-ba08-4dc3-9f13-187e97f479ff" label="lyrics-like">de pro-fún¬</l><l xml:id="m-8fdb35fe-8193-4011-a79b-96a79f31c87c" facs="#m-b0674b7a-d5a8-4a19-b45f-f7aa9404e675" label="lyrics-like">Dómi-ne.</l><l xml:id="m-e08a0458-e5ba-4fc7-a9e1-ffe40d320807" facs="#m-60d24f62-573a-49d2-b0fd-bb9c2788575c" label="lyrics-like">dis clamá¬ vi ad te,</l><l xml:id="m-5603b5b4-25d6-486b-911a-b3b4b5408942" facs="#m-32035953-b1e1-4c6d-9b51-811ad1dc941e" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-00cf81b3-6509-4054-983c-9dc2adbd7804" facs="#m-7810ee0f-7b4d-4d99-9b61-69d5afaf4451" label="lyrics-like">DRO nostrae servitútis augménto) offérimus:ut quod imméritis contu¬</l><l xml:id="m-99d90127-0011-40f6-a1d2-736b85558418" facs="#m-bc0d22d1-3273-4985-abeb-6e4ec85ec4f2" label="lyrics-like">Lsacrificium tibi, Dómine, laudis ! listi, propitius exsequáris. Per Dñum.</l><l xml:id="m-2a4ccd73-7272-4f97-ab04-4a96a201d1c6" facs="#m-38780e37-37a3-4781-b669-824d4bc7bcce" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-e881a8e4-5f09-4aff-8336-ab38835bdcd5" facs="#m-b5ad9f97-6d55-4eb4-ad7a-e4b85cc40a58" label="ambiguous">comm.8</l><l xml:id="m-0b466c19-a0e1-472d-8bde-c3694ece8e89" facs="#m-7cfaadbe-dbfd-40d7-a54e-3417ed82d96b" label="ambiguous">I.</l><l xml:id="m-a0f99192-b8e3-4e08-800a-0f675d35f071" facs="#m-9d89020c-524f-4960-bcc7-51176a036661" label="lyrics-like">-men díco vó¬ bis, * quídquid orántes pé¬ ti-tis,</l><l xml:id="m-e003055e-5e05-488c-99e4-b4cc8224567e" facs="#m-af199a08-e0c6-428d-83dc-917a63b9eb17" label="lyrics-like">cré-di-te qui-a acci-pi- é tis, et fí- et vó¬ bis.</l><l xml:id="m-2e2d7154-7ae2-4588-b970-59e9f96ff509" facs="#m-7b0295bf-3d6d-43d2-890c-85fc8dfb7e03" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-ea1aec97-fb90-4418-936b-1b33fbf82fbf" facs="#m-47904918-de72-4cbe-81b1-33b72e28ae01" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus, omnípotens Deus: patióne gaudére, humánis non sinas</l><l xml:id="m-9d33451e-6d2e-4fd0-935a-67b4e1781f53" facs="#m-03ec78ab-ddc1-4e39-a541-f66cc1dc0614" label="lyrics-like">Uut quos divína tríbuis partici- subjacére perículis. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e3eb737e-9384-4cf6-a3ca-cb866f79ed71" facs="#m-d55e8561-f827-4b82-984d-c6fedaf1fd74" label="lyrics-like">2. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-c7ab2dad-ce5b-408c-b122-147c581f23fb" facs="#m-e3f112aa-2173-4141-87d4-0345b0529fbb" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-3dead812-a80e-47b1-a3a7-0905bca03ff1" facs="#m-72895edb-b1b0-4ce5-840b-d1a6c97d81be" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-38af5cbf-1ed2-4f2a-ad5d-94f6ae784ba6" facs="#m-9f4c3f49-1cac-4c32-8d44-423d3a8c7eff" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.f</l><l xml:id="m-e308192d-c07d-45f8-8981-0d41a2a3be9a" facs="#m-5790cbde-b61d-40d0-9441-6a567a628c48" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-34c05e77-723e-4a98-bc9e-a7c194f71f20" facs="#m-48913e37-18ef-4604-aeae-e7644077fed6" label="lyrics-like">T Jésus convérsus, * et vídens é-am, dí-xit:</l><l xml:id="m-d62be59a-f4da-4088-9eda-923de8e33bfa" facs="#m-c7edace0-6a3c-4b62-ab21-62504bb94eb0" label="lyrics-like">Confíde, fí-li-a: fides tú-a te sálvam fé-cit, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-6ed19d39-2f37-47cd-bb23-0018734919b0" facs="#m-31a5017a-5ce6-416f-be56-f86c751bf2c7" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-1cca94ee-4edb-4579-ad22-adaa707368b6" facs="#m-2d98bf15-d7f6-425c-b1dc-48632fc0645c" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magnificat. I. f. p. 207. — Prayer. Absólve. p. 1074.</l><l xml:id="m-1a3f9a16-b281-4d58-821f-4234e64319d8" facs="#m-aecb6de0-7279-45ba-9fa3-9aa009654ee1" label="text-like">There can never be fewer than twventy-three Sundays after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-3d0bc541-945a-4b66-b80f-1f7c3f2c5e86" facs="#m-5d16818a-ccff-4241-b515-89b70b695434" label="text-like">nor more than twenty-eight. The Mass of the twventy-fourth Sunday is</l><l xml:id="m-693a4513-61b7-4281-aa0d-bd83883e8c9f" facs="#m-ca1a255f-8ae6-4450-93b5-ec7a7c0a7acd" label="text-like">alwars reserved for the last Sunday. On the Sundays which intervene</l><l xml:id="m-e4f5ca9a-0f1b-432c-a5ef-8cc8a249a136" facs="#m-0551cf61-0bfb-4d5d-b0d7-8776d0fb7044" label="lyrics-like">between the tweniy-third and the last Sunday, the Collẽct, the Epistle, the</l><l xml:id="m-cad31fe0-83b6-46be-9a89-47ca22ccd4b8" facs="#m-0e05c690-6a2c-4558-8c87-c3a488a13bf0" label="lyrics-like">Gospel, the Secrêt, the Postcommunion, the Prayer at Vespers, and the</l><l xml:id="m-aca5d761-3ffe-42df-9504-ba592a0efbb4" facs="#m-2d612912-d55c-48db-a2b3-dcc1ca0c2fd2" label="text-like">Antiphon ot the Magnificat are taken from the Sundays that were omitted</l><l xml:id="m-32737514-67b6-4b16-8b64-0a3f275e0f08" facs="#m-2e92d184-1b93-4501-85bd-372194d6fca2" label="text-like">aster the Epiphany:</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>